# The ending the_last_train_out (data/endings/the_last_train_out.json): the narration the ending screen plays before its slides. The Vagrant tells it
# afterwards: second person, present tense, one or two sentences a line, no game words. First draft by Claude; Gemini edits it.

~ start
Narrator: You hit the platform running, and the Ghostlight Express is already moving, the Vagrant leaning out of the cab with one hand down for you.
Narrator: Behind you the moon fills the whole sky, and then the mist closes over the Hollow like a lid on a jar.
the_vagrant: Don't look back, now. Some songs you only get to hear the once.
